igned}]\\operatorname{sin}⁡(4t)+[\\begin{aligned}7 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}]\\operatorname{cos}⁡(t)\n$$\n\nwhere $x(t)=[\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}(t) \\\\ {x}_{2}(t)\\end{aligned}].$" #edb/ref 17592186045417]}
